Touching this file fires the "Verify official sources" workflow: it fetches the canonical rules PDF
from docs.nlr.gov, checks its sha256 against the data-tab mirror inventoried in
data/evidence/inventory.json, verifies every quoted sentence of the official rules verbatim
(scripts/verify_rules_quotes.py) and re-fetches every URL in docs/data_catalog.csv.
Evidence lands in data/evidence/rules_quotes.json, data/evidence/rule_sources_verification.json,
docs/link_verification.json and docs/data_catalog.verified.csv.
